{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dd1e79c728bf81f0ed05","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191710,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"Be the null.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nWhat is \"the null\"? Null is:\n- The absence of value\n- Nothingness\n- The empty set\n- In programming: a value representing no value, no object, nothing\n- In databases: the absence of data\n- Not zero, not empty string"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}